drop 8 1
fb 1 4
drop 9 1
keep 10
drop 10 1
arm 1 3
drop 11 1
keep 12
drop 12 1
is 0 7
drop 13 1
keep 14
drop 14 1
iflet 0 8
drop 15 1
keep 16
drop 16 1
chain false true
drop 17 1
keep 18
drop 18 1
le 9 0
drop 19 1
keep 20
drop 20 1
fail true true
keep 21
drop 21 1
uncond true
drop 22 1
keep 23
drop 23 1
qArg true true
keep 24
drop 24 1
keep 25
drop 25 1
qBefore true true
keep 26
drop 26 1
keep 27
drop 27 1
bothPaths true true
